## §Z Inventory shorts (additions)

### Click modifiers
- Plain click: cursor pickup (inventory) / move-one (vendor, storage)
- Shift+click: full-stack transfer to other inventory
- Ctrl+click: same as plain in inventory (cursor pickup); move-one in vendor/storage
- Right-click: split-in-half (cursor takes half)

Click semantics differ between panels deliberately — vendor and storage have a
two-pile mental model; inventory has a cursor pickup model.

### Capacity changes
- `Inventory.capacity_changed(new_max: int)` signal fires on `expand_slots()` and
  in `load_state()`. UIs subscribe and rebuild widgets reactively.

